WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,010 --> 00:00:02,210
Don't anger them

2
00:00:02,210 --> 00:00:03,250
Stay calm for now

3
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:08,060
We have to be careful

4
00:00:08,380 --> 00:00:09,780
They were my neighbors before

5
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:11,380
The one with the humblest job is the younger son

6
00:00:11,700 --> 00:00:13,340
I guess it has become lost

7
00:00:13,500 --> 00:00:15,100
Just tied and wrapped

8
00:00:15,810 --> 00:00:16,810
What should we do?

9
00:00:17,090 --> 00:00:23,750
You can't run away outside with these people carrying what looks like guns and pads around their waists.

10
00:00:23,750 --> 00:00:24,950
He should be a good fighter

11
00:00:25,350 --> 00:00:26,550
If there really is no way to escape

12
00:00:26,710 --> 00:00:27,830
They get sick and hurt people again

13
00:00:28,030 --> 00:00:28,990
Can only kill

14
00:00:28,990 --> 00:00:30,110
Keep normal people first

15
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:37,000
Let’s talk to the big boss.

16
00:00:37,440 --> 00:00:38,400
his security detail

17
00:00:38,400 --> 00:00:40,600
Maybe they can be put to use

18
00:00:40,600 --> 00:00:42,080
It seems like they are always watching what we do

19
00:00:44,170 --> 00:00:59,240
Find a chance later, big boss, good big boss

20
00:00:59,600 --> 00:01:00,760
You drove out of town too

21
00:01:01,360 --> 00:01:02,880
I thought you were going to fly away.
